Park, NC. Research Triangle Park, NC</publisher-loc><publisher-name>National Toxicology Program</publisher-name><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://ntp.niehs.nih.gov/go/17355">http://ntp.niehs.nih.gov/go/17355</ext-link></comment><access-date>accessed 2 February 2007</access-date></citation></ref><ref id="b12-ehp0115-001351"><citation citation-type="book"><collab>NTP</collab><year>2005b</year><article-title>Report on Carcinogens</article-title><edition>11</edition><publisher-loc>Research Triangle Park, NC</publisher-loc><publisher-name>National Toxicology Program</publisher-name><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://ntp.niehs.nih.gov/go/19914">http://ntp.niehs.nih.gov/go/19914</ext-link></comment><access-date>accessed 2 February 2007</access-date></citation></ref><ref id="b13-ehp0115-001351"><citation citation-type="web"><collab>NTP</collab><year>2005c</year><article-title>Roadmap to Achieve the NTP Vision (10 March 2005)</article-title><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://ntp.niehs.nih.gov/go/vision">http://ntp.niehs.nih.gov/go/vision</ext-link></comment><access-date>accessed 2 February 2007</access-date></citation></ref><ref id="b14-ehp0115-001351"><citation citation-type="book"><collab>NTP</collab><year>2006a</year><article-title>Draft NTP Technical Report on the Toxicology and Carcinogenesis Study of Genistein (CAS No. 446&#x02013;72&#x02013;0) in Sprague-Dawley Rats (Feed Study)</article-title><publisher-loc>Research Triangle Park, NC</publisher-loc><publisher-name>National Toxicology Program</publisher-name><comment>Available: <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://ntp.niehs.nih.gov/go/28023">http://ntp.niehs.nih.gov/go/28023</ext-link></comment><access-date>accessed 2 February 2007</access-date></citation></ref><ref id="b15-ehp0115-001351"><citation citation-type="book"><collab>NTP (National Toxicology Program)</collab><year>2006b</year><article-title>NTP